WEBVTT

00:00:08,910 --> 00:00:15,070
But can I do Budwig cottage cheese and flax seed? So this is the Budwig protocol if I'm told to

00:00:15,070 --> 00:00:20,990
limit dairy. We've had this question about two dozen times over the years. And the answer is

00:00:21,710 --> 00:00:29,310
if you ask the Budwig people that they'll say, oh, when you add flax seed to dairy, you change the

00:00:29,310 --> 00:00:37,790
properties of dairy and it doesn't negatively affect you anymore. Well, that is just not a good answer

00:00:37,790 --> 00:00:45,870
because that is just not true. You know, you can't change the protein in the dairy by adding

00:00:45,870 --> 00:00:51,950
flax seed to it. It's still going to have the same components, still has the same peptides,

00:00:51,950 --> 00:00:59,790
it's still going to stimulate the mTOR pathway. So that is, you know, whatever, regardless of what

00:00:59,790 --> 00:01:10,350
they tell you on the Budwig website, it's still a dairy product. Now again, you know, if you,

00:01:10,350 --> 00:01:16,030
if the person is like I really feel like God is leading me to do the Budwig protocol,

00:01:17,550 --> 00:01:24,350
try this for a month, then by all means, you know, override what I told you about dairy and do it.

00:01:24,350 --> 00:01:28,990
And if you feel like this is what God is telling you to do. But if you just are grasping that straws

00:01:28,990 --> 00:01:34,430
because you read that somebody on Facebook used the Budwig protocol and it helped their cancer,

00:01:35,550 --> 00:01:42,270
then I, you know, no, I mean, you're, you're not supposed to act that way. We're not supposed

00:01:42,270 --> 00:01:47,870
to make decisions that way in anything in life. Are you supposed to make decisions that way?

00:01:48,510 --> 00:01:55,630
So by all means, you know, be praying about your decisions and you're asking me this question,

00:01:55,630 --> 00:02:02,350
I would say, no, you shouldn't do that. But by all means, you know, you pray about it and

00:02:02,350 --> 00:02:11,550
do what God's telling you to do, that's more important.

